From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 18:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(reporting): discover templates across KB binding mismatch

Keep the persisted patient-examination knowledge-base binding fail-closed for
findings, draft verification, report generation, export, and finalization.

When that binding differs from the active installed lx-dtypes bundle, still
query the active bundle's versioned reporting-context projection so the global
template selector accurately reflects the content that is installed. Use a
typed mismatch error so ordinary load failures and superseded route contexts do
not trigger cross-context discovery.

Base: wg-lux/lx-annotate@24242d4deec2e39e9a47e87c9a9f625053d0fd8d

---
